{
  "_doc": "The preset fields of the fixes panel (app/fixes_panel.js, docs/osm-editing.md). One list for each kind of object (road, building, node, and new_road for a road that the person draws). key: an OSM tag, or, with rule: true, a key of an overrides rule that acts for each mode (oneway, lanes, layer, turn lanes). type: choice (options: [value, label]; a value that is not in the list is kept), text, int or color. group: the section of a field in the form (the panel shows the fields in the order of this file, one section for each group).",
